d border border-emerald-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-emerald-950\">山代温泉　吉田屋　山王閣</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">2021年・2022年、温泉露天風呂付客室13室オープン！かになどお料理プランや貸切風呂も人気です！</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F11043%2F11043.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      👉 山代温泉　吉田屋　山王閣のプラン・空室を見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/10 via-teal-500/10 to-green-500/10 border border-emerald-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\">✨ おすすめ 第6位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">熊本県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800\">⭐ 4.78 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/16334/16334.jpg\" alt=\"山鹿温泉　清流荘\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-emerald-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-emerald-950\">山鹿温泉　清流荘</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-emerald-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">こだわりの会席料理を楽しむ